    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:definition"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000043</IRI>
        <Literal>Used when the age is a range and the exact birthdate is not known. This variable is a character field for the purposes of defining age ranges, e.g., if the information available for the age of the subject is 6-8 and AGEU is WEEKS. Populate only when BRTHDTC or AGE is not specified. The format for AGETXT is &quot;number-number&quot; (e.g., 6-8).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:exactMatch"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000043</IRI>
