    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:definition"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000060</IRI>
        <Literal>Short name of the measurement, test, or examination described in LBTEST. It can be used as a column name when converting a dataset from a vertical to a horizontal format. The value in LBTESTCD cannot be longer than 8 characters, nor can it start with a number (e.g., &quot;1TEST&quot; is not valid). LBTESTCD cannot contain characters other than letters, numbers, or underscores. Examples: ALT, LDH.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
