        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000128</IRI>
        <Literal>SPECIES</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000129</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000129</IRI>
        <Literal>Free-text field that allows the sponsor to enter further details qualifiying the SPECIES and/or STRAIN, depending on the level to which these variables were defined. Examples include the description of a specific genetic alteration, country of origin for non-human primates, details related to coat color (e.g., White and Red designations for New Zealand Rabbits), and important animal husbandry information (e.g., SPF, BR, VAF).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000129</IRI>
        <Literal>Strain_Substrain_Details</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000129</IRI>
        <Literal>SBSTRAIN</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000130</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000130</IRI>
        <Literal>The sequence number must be unique for each record with a USUBJID or POOLID</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000130</IRI>
        <Literal>Sequence_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000130</IRI>
        <Literal>EXSEQ</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000131</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000131</IRI>
        <Literal>Identification of focus of study-specific interest on or withina subject or specimen as defined in protocol.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000131</IRI>
        <Literal>Focus_Of_Study_Specific_Interest</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000131</IRI>
        <Literal>FOCID</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000132</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000132</IRI>
        <Literal>If the amount of treatment administered cannot be represented as a number and populated in EXDOSE, this field is used to describe the amount of treatment administered. Example: 200-400.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000132</IRI>
        <Literal>Dose_Description</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000132</IRI>
        <Literal>EXDOSTXT</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000133</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000133</IRI>
        <Literal>Dose form of treatment.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000133</IRI>
        <Literal>Dose_Form</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000133</IRI>
        <Literal>EXDOSFRM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000134</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000134</IRI>
        <Literal>Usually expressed as the number of repeated administrations of EXDOSE within a specific time period.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000134</IRI>
        <Literal>Dosing_Frequency_Per_Interval</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000134</IRI>
        <Literal>EXDOSFRQ</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000135</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000135</IRI>
        <Literal>Lot Number(s) or Batch Number(s) of the EXTRT test article. If mixed lots of the test article are administered during the same constant dosing interval, this should be represented as &quot;Lot A;Lot B.&quot; Mixed lots are produced by the mixing of Lots a and B of the test article into one solution.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000135</IRI>
        <Literal>Lot_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000135</IRI>
        <Literal>EXLOT</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000136</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000136</IRI>
        <Literal>Specifies anatomical location (site) of administration. Example: LEFT HINDLIMB for a topical application or an injection site number. Each administration will require its own record.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000136</IRI>
        <Literal>Location_Of_Dose_Administration</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000136</IRI>
        <Literal>EXLOC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000137</IRI>
        <Literal>EXMETHOD</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000137</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000137</IRI>
        <Literal>Method of dose administration.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000137</IRI>
        <Literal>Method_Of_Administration</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000138</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000138</IRI>
        <Literal>Describes reason or explanation of why a dose is adjusted – used only when an adjustment is represented in EX. May be used for variations from protocol-specified doses or changes from expected doses (e.g., when dose is adjusted due to toxicity).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000138</IRI>
        <Literal>Reason_For_Dose_Adjustment</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000138</IRI>
        <Literal>EXADJ</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000139</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000139</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time when administration of the treatment indicated by EXTRT and EXDOSE began, in ISO 8601 format.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000139</IRI>
        <Literal>Start_Date_Time_Of_Treatment</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000139</IRI>
        <Literal>EXSTDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000140</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000140</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time when administration of the treatment indicated by EXTRT and EXDOSE ended, in ISO 8601 format.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000140</IRI>
        <Literal>End_Date_Time_Of_Char_Treatment</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000140</IRI>
        <Literal>EXENDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000141</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000141</IRI>
        <Literal>Text description of time when a dose should be given. Note: This may be represented as an elapsed time relative to a fixed reference point, such as time of last dose. See EXTPTNUM and EXTPTREF.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000141</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Time_Point_Name</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000141</IRI>
        <Literal>EXTPT</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000142</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000142</IRI>
        <Literal>Numerical version of EXTPT to aid in sorting.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000142</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Time_Point_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000142</IRI>
        <Literal>EXTPTNUM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000143</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000143</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned elapsed time (in ISO 8601 format) relative to the planned fixed reference (EXTPTREF). This variable is useful where there are repetitive measures. Not a clock time or a date time variable. Represented as an ISO 8601 duration. Examples: &quot;- PT15M&quot; to represent the period of 15 minutes prior to the reference point indicated by EXTPTREF, or &quot;PT8H&quot; to represent the period of 8 hours after the reference point indicated by EXTPTREF.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000143</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Elapsed_Time_From_Time_Point_Ref</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000143</IRI>
        <Literal>EXELTM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000144</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000144</IRI>
        <Literal>Name of the fixed reference point referred to by EXELTM, if used for EXTPTNUM, and EXTPT. It is recommended that EXTPTREF be as descriptive as possible so the reference time point can be inferred without looking at other variables. Examples: Previous dose, previous feed.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000144</IRI>
        <Literal>Time_Point_Reference</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000144</IRI>
        <Literal>EXTPTREF</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000145</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000145</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time of the reference time point, EXTPTREF</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000145</IRI>
        <Literal>Date_Time_Of_Reference_Time_Point</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000145</IRI>
        <Literal>EXRFTDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000146</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.ILANGO</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000146</IRI>
        <Literal>The sequence number must be unique for each record within a USUBJID or POOLID, whichever applies for the record.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000146</IRI>
        <Literal>Sequence_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
