        <Literal>Y if the result should be excluded from all calculations, otherwise null.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000174</IRI>
        <Literal>Exclusion_Flag</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000174</IRI>
        <Literal>CLEXCLFL</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000175</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000175</IRI>
        <Literal>The reason the result should be excluded from all calculations. Used only when CLEXCLFL is Y.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000175</IRI>
        <Literal>Reason_for_Exclusion</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000175</IRI>
        <Literal>CLREASEX</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000176</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000176</IRI>
        <Literal>Indicates whether the timing of a performed test or observation was unscheduled. If a test or observation was performed based upon a schedule defined in the protocol, this flag should be null. Expected values are Y or null.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000176</IRI>
        <Literal>Unscheduled_Flag</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000176</IRI>
        <Literal>CLUSCHFL</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000177</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000177</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time of the clinical observation in ISO 8601 format. For measurements related to a continuous evaluation interval, CLDTC should be used to indicate the start date/time of that interval.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000177</IRI>
        <Literal>Date_Time_of_Observation</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000177</IRI>
        <Literal>CLDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000178</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000178</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time of end of observation interval, in ISO 8601 format. Should be populated when CLDTC represents the start date/time of a continuous evaluation interval.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000178</IRI>
        <Literal>End_Date_Time_of_Observation</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000178</IRI>
        <Literal>CLENDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000179</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000179</IRI>
        <Literal>Study day of the end of observation. Can be populated when CLENDTC represents the start day of a continuous evaluation interval. The algorithm for calculations must be relative to the sponsor-defined RFSTDTC variable in the Demographics (DM) domain.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000179</IRI>
        <Literal>Study_Day_of_End_of_Observation</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000179</IRI>
        <Literal>CLENDY</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000180</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000180</IRI>
        <Literal>Nominal study day used for grouping records for observations that may occur on different days into a single reported study day. Should be an integer.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000180</IRI>
        <Literal>Nominal_Study_Day_for_Tabulations</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000180</IRI>
        <Literal>CLNOMDY</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000181</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000181</IRI>
        <Literal>A label for a given value of CLNOMDY as presented in the study report. Examples: Week 4, Day 28, Terminal Sac.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000181</IRI>
        <Literal>Label_for_Nominal_Study_Day</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000181</IRI>
        <Literal>CLNOMLBL</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000182</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000182</IRI>
        <Literal>Text description of time when an observation should be taken, as defined in the protocol. This may be represented as an elapsed time relative to a fixed reference point, such as time postdose.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000182</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Time_Point_Name</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000182</IRI>
        <Literal>CLTPT</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000183</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000183</IRI>
        <Literal>Numerical version of CLTPT to aid in sorting.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000183</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Time_Point_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000183</IRI>
        <Literal>CLTPTNUM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000184</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000184</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned Elapsed time (in ISO 8601 format) relative to a planned reference (CLTPTREF). This variable is useful where there are repetitive measures. Not a clock time or a date time variable. Represented as an ISO 8601 duration. Examples: -PT15M to represent the period of 15 minutes prior to the reference point indicated by CLTPTREF, or PT8H to represent the period of 8 hours after the reference point indicated by CLTPTREF.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000184</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Elapsed_Time_from_Time_Point_Ref</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000184</IRI>
        <Literal>CLELTM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000185</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000185</IRI>
        <Literal>Name of the fixed reference point referred to by CLELTM, if used for CLTPTNUM, and CLTPT. It is recommended that CLTPTREF be as descriptive as possible, so the reference time point can be inferred without looking at other variables. Examples: PREVIOUS DOSE, PREVIOUS MEAL.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000185</IRI>
        <Literal>Time_Point_Reference</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000185</IRI>
        <Literal>CLTPTREF</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000186</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000186</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time of the reference time point, CLTPTREF.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000186</IRI>
        <Literal>Date_Time_of_Reference_Time_Point</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000186</IRI>
        <Literal>CLRFTDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000187</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000187</IRI>
        <Literal>The sequence number must be unique for each record within a USUBJID or POOLID, whichever applies for the record.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000187</IRI>
        <Literal>Sequence_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000187</IRI>
        <Literal>LBSEQ</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000188</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000188</IRI>
        <Literal>Used to tie together a block of related records in a single domain for a subject or pool. This is not the treatment group number.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000188</IRI>
        <Literal>Group_Identifier</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000188</IRI>
        <Literal>LBGRPID</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000189</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000189</IRI>
        <Literal>Internal or external specimen identifier. Example: 1009570101.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000189</IRI>
        <Literal>Specimen_Identifier</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000189</IRI>
        <Literal>LBREFID</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000190</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000190</IRI>
        <Literal>Sponsor-defined reference identifier. Example: Line number on the Lab page.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000190</IRI>
