        <IRI>DKFZ000207</IRI>
        <Literal>LBDIR</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000208</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000208</IRI>
        <Literal>Indicator used to identify fasting status. The value should be Y or null.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000208</IRI>
        <Literal>Fasting_Status</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000208</IRI>
        <Literal>LBFAST</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000209</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000209</IRI>
        <Literal>Used to indicate a derived record. The value should be Y or null. Records that represent the average of other records, or are not as originally received or collected, are examples of records that might be derived for the submission datasets.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000209</IRI>
        <Literal>Derived_Flag</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000209</IRI>
        <Literal>LBDRVFL</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000210</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000210</IRI>
        <Literal>Description of toxicity quantified by LBTOXGR. The sponsor is expected to provide the name and version of the scale used to map the terms, utilizing the data definition file external codelist attributes.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000210</IRI>
        <Literal>Toxicity</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000210</IRI>
        <Literal>LBTOX</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000211</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000211</IRI>
        <Literal>Records toxicity grade value using a standard toxicity scale (such as the NCI CTCAE). If value is from a numeric scale, represent only the number (e.g., 2 and not Grade 2).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000211</IRI>
        <Literal>Standard_Toxicity_Grade</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000211</IRI>
        <Literal>LBTOXGR</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000212</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000212</IRI>
        <Literal>Y if the result should be excluded from all calculations, otherwise null.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000212</IRI>
        <Literal>Exclusion_Flag</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000212</IRI>
        <Literal>LBEXCLFL</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000213</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000213</IRI>
        <Literal>The reason the result should be excluded from all calculations. Used only when LBEXCLFL is Y.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000213</IRI>
        <Literal>Reason_for_Exclusion</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000213</IRI>
        <Literal>LBREASEX</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000214</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000214</IRI>
        <Literal>Indicates whether the timing of the specimen collection was unscheduled. If a specimen collection was performed based upon a schedule defined in the protocol, this flag should be null. Expected values are Y or null.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000214</IRI>
        <Literal>Unscheduled_Flag</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000214</IRI>
        <Literal>LBUSCHFL</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000215</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000215</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time of specimen collection, in ISO 8601 format.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000215</IRI>
        <Literal>Date_Time_of_Specimen_Collection</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000215</IRI>
        <Literal>LBDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000216</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000216</IRI>
        <Literal>Date/Time of the end of specimen collection in ISO 8601 format. Should be populated only for continuous sample collection.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000216</IRI>
        <Literal>End_Date_Time_of_Specimen_Collection</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000216</IRI>
        <Literal>LBENDTC</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000217</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000217</IRI>
        <Literal>Text description of time when specimen should be taken. This may be represented as an elapsed time relative to a fixed reference point, such as time of last dose. Examples: Start, 5 min post.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000217</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Time_Point_Name</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000217</IRI>
        <Literal>LBTPT</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000218</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000218</IRI>
        <Literal>Numerical version of LBTPT to aid in sorting.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000218</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Time_Point_Number</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000218</IRI>
        <Literal>LBTPTNUM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000219</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000219</IRI>
        <Literal>Elapsed time (in ISO 8601 format) relative to a planned fixed reference (LBTPTREF). This variable is useful where there are repetitive measures. Not a clock time or a date time variable. Represented as an ISO 8601 duration. Examples: -P15M to represent the period of 15 minutes prior to the reference point indicated by LBTPTREF, or P8H to represent the period of 8 hours after the reference point indicated by LBTPTREF.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000219</IRI>
        <Literal>Planned_Elapsed_Time_from_Time_Point_Ref</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="skos:altLabel"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000219</IRI>
        <Literal>LBELTM</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="dc:creator"/>
        <IRI>DKFZ000220</IRI>
        <Literal>S.V.Ilango</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
